### Authenticate first using /api/auth/login and copy the accessToken to TOKEN
@api = http://localhost:8081/api
@companyId = 1
@TOKEN = replace-with-your-jwt

### Look up registered clients without company roles (staff only)
GET {{api}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/eligible-clients?q=ali
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Open repair for selected client ID (staff only)
POST {{api}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/for-client
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 15,
  "clientPhone": "+96170123456",
  "deviceType": "Phone",
  "brand": "Samsung",
  "model": "S24",
  "issueDescription": "Broken screen"
}

### Inventory list is already scoped to the selected company.
### Angular Store Inventory now performs instant local text filtering.
GET {{api}}/companies/{{companyId}}/inventory/items
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
